# Qwen3.6 stores routed experts as batched gate_up_proj/down_proj tensors, while
# ModelOpt NVFP4 checkpoints and SGLang's quantized FusedMoE loader use per-expert
# projection names. Expand that layout in both initial conversion and live export.
# The pinned Stitch SGLang fork also returns DFlash sampling masks aligned with
# accepted tokens, so permit that verified speculative algorithm with exact top-p
# mask replay while retaining the guard for all other speculative workers.
diff --git a/miles/backends/megatron_utils/megatron_to_hf/processors/quantizer_nvfp4.py b/miles/backends/megatron_utils/megatron_to_hf/processors/quantizer_nvfp4.py
